  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced></math> denote the determinant of a square matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the function defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be a quadratic polynomial whose roots are the maximum and minimum values of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>. Then, which of the following is/are TRUE ?",
